   "html": "<div class=\"prose\">\n<p class=\"lede\">Pour chaque objectif, les thématiques d’ADEB LONODJI qui le touchent. Seize objectifs sur dix-sept le sont par au moins une thématique ; le dernier reste vide, et nous le laissons vide plutôt que de le remplir.</p>\n<div class=\"odd-index\">\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-1\" style=\"--odd-accent:#E5243B;--odd-ink:#ffffff\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 01</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Pas de pauvreté</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#entrepreneuriat-finance-inclusive\">05 · Entrepreneuriat &amp; finance inclusive <span class=\"odd-cible\">1.4</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#solidarite-inclusion\">12 · Protection sociale &amp; inclusion <span class=\"odd-cible\">1.3</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-2\" style=\"--odd-accent:#DDA63A;--odd-ink:#10181f\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 02</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Faim « zéro »</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#agriculture-elevage-securite-alimentaire\">04 · Agriculture, élevage &amp; sécurité alimentaire <span class=\"odd-cible\">2.1 / 2.3</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-3\" style=\"--odd-accent:#4C9F38;--odd-ink:#10181f\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 03</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Bonne santé et bien-être</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#sante-prevention\">11 · Santé &amp; prévention <span class=\"odd-cible\">3.1 / 3.2 / 3.3 / 3.5 / 3.8</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-4\" style=\"--odd-accent:#C5192D;--odd-ink:#ffffff\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 04</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Éducation de qualité</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#memoire-heritage\">01 · Mémoire &amp; héritage <span class=\"odd-cible\">4.7</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#culture-patrimoine-vivant\">02 · Culture &amp; patrimoine vivant <span class=\"odd-cible\">4.7</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#savoirs-innovation\">03 · Recherche &amp; savoirs <span class=\"odd-cible\">4.7</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#jeunesse-reussite\">09 · Jeunesse &amp; réussite <span class=\"odd-cible\">4.1 / 4.4</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#intelligence-artificielle-donnees\">18 · Intelligence artificielle &amp; données <span class=\"odd-cible\">4.4</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#competences-entrepreneuriat-numerique\">19 · Compétences &amp; entrepreneuriat numérique <span class=\"odd-cible\">4.4</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-5\" style=\"--odd-accent:#FF3A21;--odd-ink:#10181f\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 05</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Égalité entre les sexes</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#leadership-feminin\">10 · Genre &amp; autonomisation des femmes <span class=\"odd-cible\">5.2 / 5.3 / 5.5</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#justice-droits-homme\">16 · Justice &amp; droits humains <span class=\"odd-cible\">5.2</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-6\" style=\"--odd-accent:#26BDE2;--odd-ink:#10181f\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 06</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Eau propre et assainissement</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#eau-energie-connectivite\">07 · Eau, énergie &amp; connectivité <span class=\"odd-cible\">6.1</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#sante-prevention\">11 · Santé &amp; prévention <span class=\"odd-cible\">6.2</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-7\" style=\"--odd-accent:#FCC30B;--odd-ink:#10181f\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 07</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Énergie propre et d’un coût abordable</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#eau-ene