ure-elevage-securite-alimentaire\">04 · Agriculture, élevage &amp; sécurité alimentaire <span class=\"odd-cible\">12.3</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#entrepreneuriat-finance-inclusive\">05 · Entrepreneuriat &amp; finance inclusive <span class=\"odd-cible\">12.5</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#environnement-ressources\">06 · Environnement &amp; ressources naturelles <span class=\"odd-cible\">12.5</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-13\" style=\"--odd-accent:#3F7E44;--odd-ink:#ffffff\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 13</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Lutte contre les changements climatiques</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#environnement-ressources\">06 · Environnement &amp; ressources naturelles <span class=\"odd-cible\">13.1</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-14\" style=\"--odd-accent:#0A97D9;--odd-ink:#10181f\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 14</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Vie aquatique</span></div>\n<p class=\"odd-row-none\">Aucune thématique ne le porte : il concerne les mers et les océans, que le Mandoul n’a pas.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-15\" style=\"--odd-accent:#56C02B;--odd-ink:#10181f\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 15</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Vie terrestre</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#agriculture-elevage-securite-alimentaire\">04 · Agriculture, élevage &amp; sécurité alimentaire <span class=\"odd-cible\">15.3</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#environnement-ressources\">06 · Environnement &amp; ressources naturelles <span class=\"odd-cible\">15.2</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-16\" style=\"--odd-accent:#00689D;--odd-ink:#ffffff\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 16</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Paix, justice et institutions efficaces</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#gouvernance-plaidoyer\">13 · Gouvernance &amp; plaidoyer <span class=\"odd-cible\">16.7 / 16.9</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#paix-cohesion\">14 · Paix &amp; cohésion <span class=\"odd-cible\">16.1</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#justice-droits-homme\">16 · Justice &amp; droits humains <span class=\"odd-cible\">16.3</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#transformation-numerique-services\">17 · Transformation numérique &amp; services <span class=\"odd-cible\">16.9</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#cellule-financement-ressources\">C1 · Cellule financement &amp; ressources <span class=\"odd-cible\">16.6</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"odd-row\" id=\"odd-17\" style=\"--odd-accent:#19486A;--odd-ink:#ffffff\">\n<div class=\"odd-row-head\"><span class=\"odd-row-num\">ODD 17</span><span class=\"odd-row-name\">Partenariats pour la réalisation des objectifs</span></div>\n<div class=\"odd-row-links\"><a href=\"/programmes#savoirs-innovation\">03 · Recherche &amp; savoirs <span class=\"odd-cible\">17.6</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#gouvernance-plaidoyer\">13 · Gouvernance &amp; plaidoyer <span class=\"odd-cible\">17.17</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#reseau-experts-diaspora\">15 · Réseau d’experts &amp; diaspora <span class=\"odd-cible\">17.17</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#intelligence-artificielle-donnees\">18 · Intelligence artificielle &amp; données <span class=\"odd-cible\">17.18</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#cellule-financement-ressources\">C1 · Cellule financement &amp; ressources <span class=\"odd-cible\">17.17</span></a><a href=\"/programmes#cellule-communication-numerique\">C2 · Cellule communication &amp; numérique <span class=\"odd-cible\">17.17</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"prose-note\">Source des intitulés : Programme de développement durable à l’horizon 2030, Nations unies, 2015. Le rapprochement avec nos thématiques est établi par ADEB LONODJI et n’engage qu’elle.</p>\n<p class=\"form-note\">Le détail d